@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Guest
actor Learner
rectangle NihonGO {
  usecase "Register an account" as Register
  usecase "Sign in" as Login
  usecase "Recover password" as Recover
  usecase "Manage account and learning goals" as Account
  usecase "Study vocabulary and review flashcards" as Vocabulary
  usecase "Look up words and Kanji" as Lookup
  usecase "Practice listening and shadowing" as Listening
  usecase "Practice AI conversation" as Speaking
  usecase "Practice reading comprehension" as Reading
  usecase "Practice writing" as Writing
  usecase "Play vocabulary games" as Games
}
Guest -- Register
Guest -- Login
Guest -- Recover
Learner -- Account
Learner -- Vocabulary
Learner -- Lookup
Learner -- Listening
Learner -- Speaking
Learner -- Reading
Learner -- Writing
Learner -- Games
@enduml
